      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Hi @{672f627ddae0fc6ba0647b60|full_name}! The RX 7900 XTX is compatible with the Creator Companion. It is unlikely that the issue is caused by your graphic card.\n\nIt's possible that the issue is related to your internet connection, your internet service provider, or something else.\n\nPlease try reviewing your VCC's log file and deleting your settings.\n\nYou can find out more in our FAQ: https://vcc.docs.vrchat.com/guides/faq#where-do-i-find-the-creator-companions-log-files",
