  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since I had Nvidia, my creator companion loaded quickly, it worked, it loaded packages without any problems, I never had a problem with the creator companion.\n\nWhen I got the RX7900 XTX, my creator companion is no longer the same, it takes more than 1 hour or more to create a project, it does not load the packages or install them, I do not know what to do anymore.\n\nI did DDU, nothing works, I uninstalled and deleted the creator companion using lemonade and nothing worked.I have already installed the adrenaline and PRO versions, nothing works. Someone with an AMD to help me please.\n\nMy creator companion version is 2.4.3.",
